          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani elunyar ŋirwa ŋulu ka akigworo lokile keŋ, kiyakiya Daudi ituŋanan ayaun aberu ŋin kai keŋ, ido abu iŋes toruwor aberu a Daudi, kidou ikoku a Daudi ŋinisapat. Nai apotu nyitalakasi Ekapolon ŋakiro ŋuna abu Daudi kitiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.11.27",
